{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "LCKE3YZ7PYR47JOX4M7D5SW4DDOUQLGS",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "501135203",
    "title": "毎日王冠にむけて",
    "enTitle": "Before the Mainichi Oukan",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "秋迫る、ある日――",
            "enText": "On a certain day as the leaves grew red —",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 56,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 3619302590938726836,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……自分は、先日のステイゴールドの様子が\nどうにも気になっていた。",
            "enText": "……I found myself pondering at Stay \nGold's demeanor from the other day.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 88,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -8224792530242825781,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "…………早過ぎる――",
            "enText": "…………She's too fast…………",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 58,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 112,
                    "pathId": -1052350535093829267
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 112,
                    "pathId": 6307777054801389040
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1448741584494564798,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……あの時のステイゴールドの様子は、\nこれまでにない緊迫感があったように思えた。",
            "enText": "…Up until now, I believe this is the first \ntime I've seen her look so tense.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 97,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 108,
                    "pathId": -5334377989257607204
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 108,
                    "pathId": 1937921610145922318
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2241719738983247639,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "言い換えると、彼女らしくないとも――",
            "enText": "In other words, it's a reaction quite \nunlike her ——",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 68,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": -1505655768402014630
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": -7825442095583134204
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -9107745858487270807,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "随分とまぁ、眉間にシワが寄ってるな。",
            "enText": "You're furrowing your brows pretty \nhard there eh.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 68,
            "voiceIdx": 80,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": -2203451429201718003
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": -5797538751893188724
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7799031528878843777,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "よう。",
            "enText": "Yo.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 48,
            "voiceIdx": 42,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ステゴ……！どうかしたのか？",
                    "enText": "Stego……! What brings you here?",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "ステゴ……！どうかしたの？",
                    "enText": "Stego……! What brings you here?",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": 5622214429402712082
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": -6822072269281594263
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 132,
                    "pathId": 5181257695610608426
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 163,
                    "pathId": 2146711819648151619
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5689878257417815192,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女が自分から現れるのは、非常に珍しい。\n何かあったのだろうかと思い、問うと――",
            "enText": "For Stay Gold herself to be the one finding \nme for once is extremely rare. Something \nmust've happened, and upon asking —",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 97,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 108,
                    "pathId": 8870704713357084047
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 108,
                    "pathId": -8189389075455207290
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5941526108050931555,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "スズカが次に出るレースが何か、\n調べてくれないか？",
            "enText": "Suzuka's next race, could you find \nout what it is?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 77,
            "voiceIdx": 52,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "構わないけど……どうして？",
                    "enText": "Sure but… Why?",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": -1470285778536517252
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 88,
                    "pathId": -807914691630370228
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1536714806045494226,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "……少し、気になることがあってな。",
            "enText": "…I'm just a little curious, that's all.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 67,
            "voiceIdx": 37,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 55,
                    "pathId": -8487303820350410082
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 78,
                    "pathId": 1390511236807118067
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5745082141316006792,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "――調べたところ、サイレンススズカが\n直近で『毎日王冠』出走への意欲を\n表明していることがすぐにわかった。",
            "enText": "Upon checking the records, Silence \nSuzuka has submitted her entry for \nher next race to be the Mainichi Okan.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 207,
                    "pathId": -8152727945135192211
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 199,
                    "pathId": -2098857238596063609
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7129480036385136387,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "『毎日王冠』、か――",
            "enText": "The Mainichi Okan huh ——",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 58,
            "voiceIdx": 79,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……俺たちも出走するか？",
                    "enText": "……Should we also participate?",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "……私たちも出走する？",
                    "enText": "……Should we also participate?",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 121,
                    "pathId": 3108543539762153866
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 71,
                    "pathId": -8107396904402240092
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 69,
                    "pathId": -1966472133953734001
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2304878659878109824,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "……ハハッ、えらく話が早いな。",
            "enText": "<i>……Haha,</i> you knew just the words \nto say huh.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 64,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 102450913495273398
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 168,
                    "pathId": 3300125833540923077
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 75,
                    "pathId": -1501425105130204502
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7578638031179420730,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "じゃあ、お言葉に甘えさせてもらうよ。\n『毎日王冠』を走らせてくれ。",
            "enText": "Then, I'll be taking that offer of yours. \nLet me run in the Mainichi Okan.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 88,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 47,
                    "pathId": -559628401217140122
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 99,
                    "pathId": 6651715472239612761
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -646899414644110626,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "もしかしたらこれで、\n見えてくるかもしれないんでな。",
            "enText": "Perhaps this way, I'll be able to see it.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 78,
            "voiceIdx": 37,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……いったい何が？",
                    "enText": "……What do you mean by that?",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 59,
                    "pathId": 1541898579983754083
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -1777658705907253982
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4402507952287929614,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "さぁね。\n私もそれが知りたいんだ。",
            "enText": "Beats me. That's what I'm trying \nto find out as well.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 67,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": 4563236654222798686
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 78,
                    "pathId": -3183993440076760077
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7318478140912104209,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "『毎日王冠』、当日――",
            "enText": "It's the day of the Mainichi Okan ——",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 59,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -7748850804504723032
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 2622888234979583048
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5209767565107113174,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "……さて。\n1800mでどこまでやれるかな。",
            "enText": "……Now then. Wonder how this 1800 \nmetre run is gonna turn out.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 73,
            "voiceIdx": 80,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 47,
                    "pathId": -2202859543129586120
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 84,
                    "pathId": 6627229620599992176
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4079191971525728575,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "ま、これも旅の醍醐味ってことで――",
            "enText": "Still, this is the thrill of a journey ——",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 67,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 48,
                    "pathId": 8191267566121767751
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 78,
                    "pathId": 4358264220081824509
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1264458793727213552,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "――――……！",
            "enText": "————……!",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 54,
            "voiceIdx": 110,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": -2572326269370426572
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 156,
                    "pathId": 4655538285360411651
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 189,
                    "pathId": 767338338186404160
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2871404159343161808,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "（全身を貫く気配……こいつは――――）",
            "enText": "(This sensation piercing through me… \nit could only be ———)",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 69,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6564495534357891477
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 80,
                    "pathId": 3307080289460177311
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 80,
                    "pathId": 7966153125781898590
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4985078922523850876,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "――――スズカ。",
            "enText": "————Suzuka.",
